{"strongs": "H5080", "word": "נָדַח", "translit": "na.dach", "root": "נדה", "morph": "H:V", "pos": "verb", "gloss": "impel, thrust, banish", "definition": "[ נָדַח ] verb impel, thrust, banish (especially Deuteronomy, Jeremiah and later) (Late Hebrew id., beguile , Hiph, Niph`al; Aramaic נְדַח (rare) = Biblical Hebrew; Ethiopic ; thrust ; Arabic is drive a ship to shore ); — Qal Imperfect יִדַּח 2Sam 14:14 Infinitive לִנְדֹּחַ Deut 20:19 — transitive 1. impel (i.e. wield ) an axe, followed by עַלֿ Deut 20:19 2. thrust away, banish followed by מִןֿ 2Sam 14:14 . Niph`al Perfect 3 feminine singular נִדְּחָה Job 6:13 , etc.; ( Imperfect יִדַּ֫חוּ Jer 23:12 see דחח ); Participle נִדָּח 2Sam 14:14 נִדָּחָה Mic 4:6 + 2 t.; נִדַּ֫חַת Ezek 34:4 ; Ezek 34:16 , etc. On נִדְחֵי Isa 11:12 ; Isa 56:8 ; Ps 147:2 see Ki Kö i. 317 ; — 1. be impelled: וְנִדְּחָה יָרוֺ בַּגַּרְוֶן be impelled with the axe Deut 19:5 . 2. be thrust out, banished: of dispersion in exile, followed by שָׁם Jer 40:12 ; Jer 43:5 (|| שׁוּב ); followed by לִפְנֵי Jer 49:5 (|| קִבֵּץ ); compare also figurative תֻּשִׁיָּה נִדְּחָה מִמֶּנִּי Job 6:13 is banished from me , i.e. is non-existent; especially Participle banished one(s), outcast(s) , as accusative of congnate meaning with verb with נָדַח 2Sam 14:14 with קִבֵּץ Mic 4:6 ; Deut 30:4 ; Zeph 3:19 ; Neh 1:9 יִשִׂרָאֵל ׳ נ , with אָסַף Isa 11:12 (|| נְפֻצוֺת יְקַבֵּץ ); with קִבֵּץ Isa 56:8 with כִּנֵּס Ps 147:2 with הֵשִׁיב 2Sam 14:13 ; Ezek 34:4 ; Ezek 34:16 (both || אֹבֵד ); with בּוֺא Isa 27:13 (|| id. ); see also Isa 16:3 ; Isa 16:4 ; Jer 49:36 outcast = neglected one , figurative of Zion Jer 30:17 (|| דֹּרֵשׁ אֵין לָהּ ). 3. driven away (from herd, i.e.) straying Deut 22:1 . 4. thrust away, aside from ׳ י to idiolatry Deut 4:19 ; Deut 30:17 (followed by וְהִשְׁתַּחֲוָה ). Pu`al Participle אֲקֵלָה מְנֻדָּח Isa 8:22 thrust into darkness . Hiph`il Perfect וְהִדִּיחַ consecutive 2Sam 15:14 הִדַּ֫חְתִּי Jer 23:3 ; Jer 29:14 , etc.; Imperfect suffix וַיַּדַּח 2Chr 21:11 + 2Kgs 17:21 Qr ; וַיַּדִּ֫יחוּ Deut 13:14 , etc.; Imperative suffix הַדִּיחֵ֫מוֺ Ps 5:11 Infinitive הַדִּיחַ Ps 62:5 , etc.; — 1. thrust, move, impel , figurative, object רָעָה 2Sam 15:14 (followed by עַלֿ . 2. thrust out, banish, especially of exile, subject ׳ י , with accusative followed by שָׁ֫מָּה Deut 30:1 ; Jer 46:28 ; Jer 16:15 (|| הֶעֱלָה ); followed by שָׁם Jer 8:3 ; Jer 24:9 ; Jer 29:18 ; Dan 9:7 + Ezek 4:13 (omitted by ᵐ5 Co ); Jer 23:3 (|| קִבֵּץ ), v Jer 23:8 (|| הֶעֱלָה , הֵבִיא ) Jer 29:14 (|| קִבֵּץ , הֵשֹׁיב ), so Jer 32:37 also Jer 27:10 (|| הַרְחִיק ), v Jer 27:15 (|| אָבַד ), compare Jer 23:2 (Judah under figure of flock, subject evil shepherd, || הֵפִיץ ), Jer 50:17 (Israel as sheep, subject enemies as lions); of driving out priests 2Chr 13:9 invader Joel 2:20 (followed by אֶלֿ ); wicked Ps 5:11 (|| הַאֲשִׁימֵם ); good man from his eminence Ps 62:5 (followed by מִן ). 3. thrust away, aside , from ׳ י to idolatry, with accusative, Deut 13:14 followed by מִןהַֿדֶּרֶךְ v. Deut 13:6 ׳ מֵעַל י v. Deut 13:11 ׳ מֵאַחֲרֵי י 2Kgs 17:21 Qr ( Kt see נדא ); compare 2Chr 21:11 (|| הִזְנָה ). 4. compel, force , subject adulteress (by flattery), followed by accusative Prov 7:21 (|| הִטָּה ). Hoph`al Participle מֻדָּח chased, hunted , ׳ צְבִי מ Isa 13:14 , simile of fugitive Babylonians.", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5001')\">BDB5001</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H5080')\">H5080</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5000')\">BDB5000</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5002')\">BDB5002</entry></div><p> [<bdbheb>נָדַח</bdbheb>] <b>verb</b> <highlightword>impel, thrust, banish</highlightword> (especially Deuteronomy, Jeremiah and later) (Late Hebrew <highlight>id., beguile</highlight>, Hiph, Niph`al; Aramaic <bdbarc>נְדַח</bdbarc> (rare) = Biblical Hebrew; Ethiopic <placeholder3188/>; <highlight>thrust</highlight>; Arabic <placeholder3189/> is <highlight>drive</highlight> a ship to<highlight> shore</highlight>); — <div class=\"point\"><b>Qal</b> <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> <bdbheb>יִדַּח</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Sam 14:14\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(10,14,14)\">2Sam 14:14</ref> Infinitive <bdbheb>לִנְדֹּחַ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 20:19\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(5,20,19)\">Deut 20:19</ref> — transitive </div><div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>impel</highlight> (i.e. <highlight>wield</highlight>) an axe, followed by<bdbheb>עַלֿ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 20:19\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(5,20,19)\">Deut 20:19</ref> </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>thrust away, banish</highlight> followed by<bdbheb>מִןֿ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Sam 14:14\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(10,14,14)\">2Sam 14:14</ref>. <b>Niph`al</b> <highlight>Perfect</highlight> 3 feminine singular <bdbheb>נִדְּחָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 6:13\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(18,6,13)\">Job 6:13</ref>, etc.; (<highlight>Imperfect</highlight> <bdbheb>יִדַּ֫חוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 23:12\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(24,23,12)\">Jer 23:12</ref> see  <bdbheb><reflink>דחח</reflink></bdbheb>); <highlight>Participle</highlight> <bdbheb>נִדָּח</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Sam 14:14\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(10,14,14)\">2Sam 14:14</ref> <bdbheb>נִדָּחָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Mic 4:6\" b=\"33\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(33,4,6)\">Mic 4:6</ref> + 2 t.; <bdbheb>נִדַּ֫חַת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 34:4\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(26,34,4)\">Ezek 34:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 34:16\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(26,34,16)\">Ezek 34:16</ref>, etc. On <bdbheb>נִדְחֵי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 11:12\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(23,11,12)\">Isa 11:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 56:8\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"56\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"56\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(23,56,8)\">Isa 56:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 147:2\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"147\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"147\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(19,147,2)\">Ps 147:2</ref> see <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ki')\">Ki</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Kö')\">Kö<sup>i. 317</sup></lookup>; — </div><div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>be impelled:</highlight> <bdbheb>וְנִדְּחָה יָרוֺ בַּגַּרְוֶן</bdbheb> <highlight>be impelled</highlight> with the axe <ref ref=\"Deut 19:5\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(5,19,5)\">Deut 19:5</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>be thrust out, banished:</highlight> of dispersion in exile, followed by <bdbheb>שָׁם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 40:12\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"40\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"40\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(24,40,12)\">Jer 40:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 43:5\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"43\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"43\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(24,43,5)\">Jer 43:5</ref> (|| <bdbheb>שׁוּב</bdbheb>); followed by <bdbheb>לִפְנֵי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 49:5\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"49\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"49\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(24,49,5)\">Jer 49:5</ref> (|| <bdbheb>קִבֵּץ</bdbheb>); compare also figurative <bdbheb>תֻּשִׁיָּה נִדְּחָה מִמֶּנִּי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 6:13\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(18,6,13)\">Job 6:13</ref> <highlight>is banished from me</highlight>, i.e. is non-existent; especially Participle <highlight>banished one(s), outcast(s)</highlight>, as accusative of congnate meaning with verb with <bdbheb>נָדַח</bdbheb><ref ref=\"2Sam 14:14\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(10,14,14)\">2Sam 14:14</ref> with <bdbheb>קִבֵּץ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Mic 4:6\" b=\"33\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(33,4,6)\">Mic 4:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 30:4\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(5,30,4)\">Deut 30:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Zeph 3:19\" b=\"36\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(36,3,19)\">Zeph 3:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"Neh 1:9\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(16,1,9)\">Neh 1:9</ref> <bdbheb>יִשִׂרָאֵל</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>נ</bdbheb>, with <bdbheb>אָסַף</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 11:12\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(23,11,12)\">Isa 11:12</ref> (|| <bdbheb>נְפֻצוֺת יְקַבֵּץ</bdbheb>); with <bdbheb>קִבֵּץ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 56:8\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"56\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"56\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(23,56,8)\">Isa 56:8</ref> with <bdbheb>כִּנֵּס</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 147:2\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"147\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"147\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(19,147,2)\">Ps 147:2</ref> with <bdbheb>הֵשִׁיב</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Sam 14:13\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(10,14,13)\">2Sam 14:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 34:4\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(26,34,4)\">Ezek 34:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 34:16\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(26,34,16)\">Ezek 34:16</ref> (both || <bdbheb>אֹבֵד</bdbheb>); with <bdbheb>בּוֺא</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 27:13\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(23,27,13)\">Isa 27:13</ref> (|| <highlight>id.</highlight>); see also <ref ref=\"Isa 16:3\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(23,16,3)\">Isa 16:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 16:4\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(23,16,4)\">Isa 16:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 49:36\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"49\" vBegin=\"36\" cEnd=\"49\" vEnd=\"36\" onclick=\"bcv(24,49,36)\">Jer 49:36</ref> <highlight>outcast = neglected one</highlight>, figurative of Zion <ref ref=\"Jer 30:17\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(24,30,17)\">Jer 30:17</ref> (|| <bdbheb>דֹּרֵשׁ אֵין לָהּ</bdbheb>). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> <highlight>driven away</highlight> (from herd, i.e.) <highlight>straying</highlight> <ref ref=\"Deut 22:1\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(5,22,1)\">Deut 22:1</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>4.</b> <highlight>thrust away, aside from</highlight> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb> <highlight>to idiolatry</highlight> <ref ref=\"Deut 4:19\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(5,4,19)\">Deut 4:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 30:17\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(5,30,17)\">Deut 30:17</ref> (followed by <bdbheb>וְהִשְׁתַּחֲוָה</bdbheb>).</p></div><div class=\"section\"><p><b>Pu`al</b> <highlight>Participle</highlight> <bdbheb>אֲקֵלָה מְנֻדָּח</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 8:22\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(23,8,22)\">Isa 8:22</ref> <highlight>thrust into darkness</highlight>.</p></div><div class=\"section\"><p><b>Hiph`il</b> <highlight>Perfect</highlight> <bdbheb>וְהִדִּיחַ</bdbheb> consecutive <ref ref=\"2Sam 15:14\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(10,15,14)\">2Sam 15:14</ref> <bdbheb>הִדַּ֫חְתִּי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 23:3\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(24,23,3)\">Jer 23:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 29:14\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(24,29,14)\">Jer 29:14</ref>, etc.; <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> suffix <bdbheb>וַיַּדַּח</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Chr 21:11\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(14,21,11)\">2Chr 21:11</ref> + <ref ref=\"2Kgs 17:21\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(12,17,21)\">2Kgs 17:21</ref> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Qr')\"><reflink>Qr</reflink></lookup>; <bdbheb>וַיַּדִּ֫יחוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 13:14\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(5,13,14)\">Deut 13:14</ref>, etc.; <highlight>Imperative</highlight> suffix <bdbheb>הַדִּיחֵ֫מוֺ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 5:11\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(19,5,11)\">Ps 5:11</ref> <highlight>Infinitive</highlight> <bdbheb>הַדִּיחַ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 62:5\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"62\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"62\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(19,62,5)\">Ps 62:5</ref>, etc.; — </div><div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>thrust, move, impel</highlight>, figurative, object <bdbheb>רָעָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Sam 15:14\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(10,15,14)\">2Sam 15:14</ref> (followed by <bdbheb>עַלֿ</bdbheb>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>thrust out, banish, especially</highlight> of exile, subject <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb>, with accusative followed by <bdbheb>שָׁ֫מָּה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 30:1\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(5,30,1)\">Deut 30:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 46:28\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"46\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"46\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(24,46,28)\">Jer 46:28</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 16:15\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(24,16,15)\">Jer 16:15</ref> (|| <bdbheb>הֶעֱלָה</bdbheb>); followed by <bdbheb>שָׁם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 8:3\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(24,8,3)\">Jer 8:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 24:9\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(24,24,9)\">Jer 24:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 29:18\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(24,29,18)\">Jer 29:18</ref>; <ref ref=\"Dan 9:7\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(27,9,7)\">Dan 9:7</ref> + <ref ref=\"Ezek 4:13\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(26,4,13)\">Ezek 4:13</ref> (omitted by <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Co')\">Co</lookup>); <ref ref=\"Jer 23:3\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(24,23,3)\">Jer 23:3</ref> (|| <bdbheb>קִבֵּץ</bdbheb>), v<ref ref=\"Jer 23:8\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(24,23,8)\">Jer 23:8</ref> (|| <bdbheb>הֶעֱלָה</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>הֵבִיא</bdbheb>) <ref ref=\"Jer 29:14\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(24,29,14)\">Jer 29:14</ref> (|| <bdbheb>קִבֵּץ</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>הֵשֹׁיב</bdbheb>), so <ref ref=\"Jer 32:37\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"37\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"37\" onclick=\"bcv(24,32,37)\">Jer 32:37</ref> also <ref ref=\"Jer 27:10\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(24,27,10)\">Jer 27:10</ref> (|| <bdbheb>הַרְחִיק</bdbheb>), v<ref ref=\"Jer 27:15\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(24,27,15)\">Jer 27:15</ref> (|| <bdbheb>אָבַד</bdbheb>), compare <ref ref=\"Jer 23:2\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(24,23,2)\">Jer 23:2</ref> (Judah under figure of flock, subject evil shepherd, || <bdbheb>הֵפִיץ</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"Jer 50:17\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"50\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"50\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(24,50,17)\">Jer 50:17</ref> (Israel as sheep, subject enemies as lions); of driving out priests <ref ref=\"2Chr 13:9\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(14,13,9)\">2Chr 13:9</ref> invader <ref ref=\"Joel 2:20\" b=\"29\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(29,2,20)\">Joel 2:20</ref> (followed by <bdbheb>אֶלֿ</bdbheb>); wicked <ref ref=\"Ps 5:11\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(19,5,11)\">Ps 5:11</ref> (|| <bdbheb>הַאֲשִׁימֵם</bdbheb>); good man from his eminence <ref ref=\"Ps 62:5\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"62\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"62\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(19,62,5)\">Ps 62:5</ref> (followed by <bdbheb>מִן</bdbheb>). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> <highlight>thrust away, aside</highlight>, from <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb> to idolatry, with accusative, <ref ref=\"Deut 13:14\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(5,13,14)\">Deut 13:14</ref> followed by <bdbheb>מִןהַֿדֶּרֶךְ</bdbheb> v.<ref ref=\"Deut 13:6\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(5,13,6)\">Deut 13:6</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מֵעַל י</bdbheb> v.<ref ref=\"Deut 13:11\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(5,13,11)\">Deut 13:11</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מֵאַחֲרֵי י</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Kgs 17:21\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(12,17,21)\">2Kgs 17:21</ref> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Qr')\"><reflink>Qr</reflink></lookup> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Kt')\"><reflink>Kt</reflink></lookup> see  <bdbheb><reflink>נדא</reflink></bdbheb>); compare <ref ref=\"2Chr 21:11\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(14,21,11)\">2Chr 21:11</ref> (|| <bdbheb>הִזְנָה</bdbheb>). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>4.</b> <highlight>compel, force</highlight>, subject adulteress (by flattery), followed by accusative <ref ref=\"Prov 7:21\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(20,7,21)\">Prov 7:21</ref> (|| <bdbheb>הִטָּה</bdbheb>).</p></div><div class=\"section\"><p><b>Hoph`al</b> <highlight>Participle</highlight> <bdbheb>מֻדָּח</bdbheb> <highlight>chased, hunted</highlight>, <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>צְבִי מ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 13:14\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(23,13,14)\">Isa 13:14</ref>, simile of fugitive Babylonians. </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "2Sam 14:14", "book": "2SA", "chapter": 14, "verse": 14}, {"raw": "Deut 20:19", "book": "DEU", "chapter": 20, "verse": 19}, {"raw": "Job 6:13", "book": "JOB", "chapter": 6, "verse": 13}, {"raw": "Jer 23:12", "book": "JER", "chapter": 23, "verse": 12}, {"raw": "Mic 4:6", "book": "MIC", "chapter": 4, "verse": 6}, {"raw": "Ezek 34:4", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 34, "verse": 4}, {"raw": "Ezek 34:16", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 34, "verse": 16}, {"raw": "Isa 11:12", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 11, "verse": 12}, {"raw": "Isa 56:8", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 56, "verse": 8}, {"raw": "Ps 147:2", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 147, "verse": 2}, {"raw": "Deut 19:5", "book": "DEU", "chapter": 19, "verse": 5}, {"raw": "Jer 40:12", "book": "JER", "chapter": 40, "verse": 12}, {"raw": "Jer 43:5", "book": "JER", "chapter": 43, "verse": 5}, {"raw": "Jer 49:5", "book": "JER", "chapter": 49, "verse": 5}, {"raw": "Deut 30:4", "book": "DEU", "chapter": 30, "verse": 4}, {"raw": "Zeph 3:19", "book": "ZEP", "chapter": 3, "verse": 19}, {"raw": "Neh 1:9", "book": "NEH", "chapter": 1, "verse": 9}, {"raw": "2Sam 14:13", "book": "2SA", "chapter": 14, "verse": 13}, {"raw": "Isa 27:13", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 27, "verse": 13}, {"raw": "Isa 16:3", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 16, "verse": 3}, {"raw": "Isa 16:4", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 16, "verse": 4}, {"raw": "Jer 49:36", "book": "JER", "chapter": 49, "verse": 36}, {"raw": "Jer 30:17", "book": "JER", "chapter": 30, "verse": 17}, {"raw": "Deut 22:1", "book": "DEU", "chapter": 22, "verse": 1}, {"raw": "Deut 4:19", "book": "DEU", "chapter": 4, "verse": 19}, {"raw": "Deut 30:17", "book": "DEU", "chapter": 30, "verse": 17}, {"raw": "Isa 8:22", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 8, "verse": 22}, {"raw": "2Sam 15:14", "book": "2SA", "chapter": 15, "verse": 14}, {"raw": "Je